# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# `add` a SPARSE pattern over a DIM base: fireflies blinking over a sky that
# fades from indigo overhead to the last amber light at the horizon. Added
# over a bright base, the sparks would vanish.
S - Fireflies at Dusk
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 70 none fill 1
N Dusk
I @pat/color-wash
C sliderScheme 0
C hsvPickerColorA 47186 58982 65536
C hsvPickerColorB 4588 62259 65536
C sliderMotion 0
C sliderBreathSeconds 1966080
C sliderFloorPercent 4587520
C sliderRepeats 32768
L pat 0 0 0 0 add 100 none fill 1
N Fireflies
I @pat/fireflies
R 100 0:000000 255:e8ff6a
